<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 5.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on November 5:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Salt		5,971/- (LDD)   329	Run Fast	   31/10</p>
<p>Granite	   1,833/- (LDD) 3,167	Hualien Express   3/11</p>
<p>Garnet Sand     2,005/- (LDD)   ---	Acadamic P	  3/11</p>
<p>Sulphur	  10,444/- (ULD)   ---	Normar Pilot     27/10</p>
<p>Sulphur	   3,250/- (ULD) 9,222	Normar Pioneer   27/10</p>
<p>Logs	     *3,800/- (ULD) 1,765	Ocean Rover	 1/11</p>
<p>Logs	     *1,592/- (ULD) 4,929	Jaipur		1/11</p>
<p>Coal	     12,089/--(ULD) 9,500	Maratha Prudance  3/11</p>
<p>Coal	     25,687/--(ULD) 4,380	Tamil Periyar     3/11</p>
<p>Urea		5,385/--(ULD)   115	Capetanissa	24/10</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	    *   - In cubic metres</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
